    "mpn": "K976DA3RN-30.00W",
    "manufacturer": "BWT Beijing",
    "family": "laser_diode",
    "description": "976 nm 30 W free-running fiber-coupled multi-single-emitter diode laser module, 105 um / 0.22 NA output fiber. A high-power CW pump source built by combining several single emitters and coupling their asymmetric radiation into a small-core multimode fiber with micro optics; used for laser pumping, medical, and material processing. Free-running (no wavelength-stabilizing VBG), so the spectrum is broad (~6 nm FWHM) and drifts with temperature and current. Includes 1040-1200 nm feedback isolation (~30 dB). Two-pin module (LD anode/cathode); no back-facet monitor photodiode and no integrated cooler are specified, so those blocks are omitted.",
    "package": "Fiber-coupled diode laser module, 2-pin (105 um core / 125 um cladding / 245 um buffer, 0.22 NA, 1 m fiber, 0.9 mm PVC loose tube)",
    "pinCount": 2,
    "lifecycle": "active",
    "temperatureGrade": "15..35 (operating case)",
    "orderingVariants": [
      { "orderCode": "K976DA3RN-30.00W", "package": "Fiber-coupled diode laser module, 2-pin" }
    ]
  },
